Short:    Easy start of TCP/TERM from FAME v1.1.
Uploader: strider@trsi.de (David Wettig)
Author:   strider@trsi.de (David Wettig)
Type:     comm/bbs

Some CLI and Arexx scripts + a CLI tool for FAME BBS Systems to start
TCP-stacks and terminals without quiting a Node by hand (FAMESuRe v1.1).
Example scripts for TERM and Miami.

